      "Administrative reality / ESO audit: An ESO on Jan 2, 2023 inspecting D will find an uncured failure to enact a policy due Oct 11, 2022. The 2-year limitation period under Part XXI means D has an active contravention on record and cannot be deemed 'in compliance'.",
