    "Camp_D_core_points": [
      "The March 1 statutory deadline argument (brilliantly introduced by Colleague 12): For the 2023 calendar year, an employer with 25+ employees has until MARCH 1, 2023 to develop a policy (ss. 21.1.2(2), 41.1.1(2)). Thus, on January 2, 2023, NO employer could possibly be non-compliant with a 2023 policy obligation! The stem's evaluation date of Jan 2, 2023 can ONLY be evaluating expired obligations (i.e. the Oct 11, 2022 electronic monitoring deadline).",
